    <string name="about_dev">Developer: MK_MANDOKHAIL</string>
    <string name="about_info">KHPAL GPS lets you choose where your device thinks it is. Pick a spot on the map and the Xposed module delivers it to the apps you select, with natural live variation: separate accuracy for the GPS, network and fused providers, adjustable altitude, speed and MSL altitude, custom horizontal and vertical accuracy, and optional random drift inside a radius you set.

Built for app developers, testers and privacy-minded users. Please use it responsibly and respect local laws and the rules of the apps you use.

KHPAL GPS is a modified version of GPS Setter by @jqssun, licensed under GPL-3.0. The original licence and copyright notices are kept in the LICENSE and NOTICE files.</string>

